WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.103
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.203 --> 00:01.373
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.373 --> 00:02.543
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.543 --> 00:03.713
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:14.090 --> 00:16.090
(One Way)

6
00:25.230 --> 00:27.300
Hey, Gyu Min. I am on my way.

7
00:27.800 --> 00:28.970
It will take about ten minutes.

8
00:29.670 --> 00:32.040
Okay, got it. See you soon. Bye.

9
01:08.180 --> 01:11.450
Look, I just spilled my coffee all of a sudden.

10
01:12.250 --> 01:14.380
I think I barely grazed you.

11
01:15.220 --> 01:17.120
You fell while dodging me.

12
01:17.180 --> 01:19.250
I honestly feel like I only brushed against your bag.

13
01:20.220 --> 01:23.590
Shouldn't you apologize first?

14
01:29.600 --> 01:32.400
Seriously, how could you speed through such...

15
01:32.900 --> 01:34.270
a narrow alley like that?

16
01:35.270 --> 01:36.640
Fine, I am sorry.

17
01:37.370 --> 01:39.040
Are you hurt badly or something?

18
01:41.540 --> 01:42.740
Do you want to go to the hospital?

19
01:46.050 --> 01:47.480
Just give me your contact information.

20
01:48.050 --> 01:50.750
Seeing you move around, it looks like no bones are broken,

21
01:51.250 --> 01:52.850
and you don't seem seriously hurt,

22
01:52.950 --> 01:54.390
so instead of changing your story later...

23
01:54.390 --> 01:55.590
about needing to be hospitalised,

24
01:55.660 --> 01:58.430
let's just go to the hospital right now. Okay?

25
02:01.430 --> 02:03.060
I have somewhere urgent to be,

26
02:03.130 --> 02:04.460
so I can't go to the hospital right now.

27
02:04.900 --> 02:07.030
I'll call you later if there's any issue,

28
02:07.230 --> 02:08.740
so just give me your phone number.

29
02:09.570 --> 02:10.770
Are you going to get hurt somewhere else...

30
02:10.840 --> 02:11.840
and blame it on me?

31
02:12.910 --> 02:14.840
Like I haven't seen insurance scammers before...

32
02:16.710 --> 02:18.480
Should we head to the police station then?

33
02:18.810 --> 02:20.580
Do you want to figure out who's the victim...

34
02:20.650 --> 02:22.380
and who's at fault by the book?

35
02:23.850 --> 02:25.550
Seriously, what is his deal...

36
02:27.720 --> 02:28.960
Hey, wait a minute.

37
02:30.660 --> 02:33.160
I'm a very busy person too. Look...

38
02:34.330 --> 02:37.230
The thing is, my father is in critical condition right now,

39
02:37.600 --> 02:39.170
so I need to hurry over too.

40
02:48.640 --> 02:50.640
(Pharmacy)

41
03:16.270 --> 03:18.240
(Episode 28)

42
03:18.840 --> 03:20.440
Pick one.

43
03:20.910 --> 03:24.110
Either throw your typical tantrum like you always do...

44
03:25.080 --> 03:28.280
or just be honest and admit you're worried about Gyu Seo.

45
03:29.650 --> 03:31.820
Why on earth would I worry about that punk?

46
03:31.890 --> 03:33.350
When did I ever?

47
03:34.920 --> 03:38.260
Still, I see some hope.

48
03:39.290 --> 03:42.060
They say you can't change who someone is,

49
03:44.560 --> 03:47.030
but who knows?

50
03:47.100 --> 03:49.470
Maybe even Han Gyu Young can turn over a new leaf.

51
03:50.970 --> 03:52.840
What are you rambling on about?

52
03:53.770 --> 03:55.340
Is your phone still off?

53
03:55.740 --> 03:57.710
Did you check if you got any messages?

54
04:04.080 --> 04:06.490
You actually listen sometimes,

55
04:06.550 --> 04:09.820
and seeing you like this, you're better than a dog.

56
04:17.000 --> 04:20.300
Han Gyu Young. If you keep testing my patience,

57
04:20.370 --> 04:23.070
- I will go after your family... - Crazy bastard...

58
04:23.140 --> 04:24.570
one by one instead.

59
04:24.640 --> 04:26.440
Come home while I am asking nicely.

60
04:26.510 --> 04:28.640
What? What is it?

61
04:29.810 --> 04:32.580
What family do I even have? I don't have a family, you idiot...

62
04:32.980 --> 04:34.450
I cut ties with every single one of them.

63
04:34.510 --> 04:36.480
What family are you talking about?

64
04:58.670 --> 04:59.910
Hello.

65
05:00.640 --> 05:02.980
Are you a new employee?

66
05:06.380 --> 05:08.750
I'm here to work...

67
05:08.850 --> 05:11.350
- as kitchen support today. - Yes.

68
05:11.790 --> 05:14.020
Could you check my back and shoulder...

69
05:14.090 --> 05:16.720
to see what they look like, by any chance?

70
05:16.960 --> 05:19.990
I do not have anyone else to ask.

71
05:20.230 --> 05:21.830
Oh, sure.

72
05:22.600 --> 05:23.760
Thank you.

73
05:30.400 --> 05:31.710
Why does it look like this?

74
05:32.510 --> 05:33.810
What happened to you?

75
05:34.910 --> 05:37.010
There was a little accident on my way here...

76
05:40.810 --> 05:44.980
I cannot reach back there. Could you put a bandage on it?

77
05:45.290 --> 05:46.790
Just so the blood does not seep through...

78
05:47.050 --> 05:48.220
Please.

79
05:51.320 --> 05:52.990
This must hurt so much...

80
05:58.370 --> 06:00.270
Should you not go to the hospital?

81
06:03.540 --> 06:06.040
I am fine. Chef Kim is all on his own,

82
06:06.110 --> 06:07.310
so I want to get out there quickly.

83
06:08.840 --> 06:09.980
That's good, thank you.

84
06:16.520 --> 06:19.520
Please keep my injury a secret today.

85
06:20.450 --> 06:21.690
Thank you.

86
06:25.990 --> 06:28.800
Why is a kitchen assistant working so hard?

87
06:47.210 --> 06:48.310
I will handle that.

88
06:49.420 --> 06:50.420
Gyu Rim.

89
06:53.390 --> 06:54.650
What should I do next?

90
06:55.760 --> 06:57.660
Yes, that is right. Keep doing that.

91
07:02.460 --> 07:04.860
Do not look at me with such suspicion, okay?

92
07:06.300 --> 07:08.940
You will be blown away. Absolutely blown away.

93
07:09.000 --> 07:10.540
Well, it definitely looks delicious.

94
07:11.040 --> 07:13.370
Five minutes will be enough to tell.

95
07:13.870 --> 07:15.140
Excuse me.

96
07:18.750 --> 07:20.450
Well, shall we have a toast?

97
07:20.510 --> 07:24.220
- Yes. Thank you. - Good to see you.

98
07:24.280 --> 07:26.120
Thank you for coming.

99
07:41.330 --> 07:42.600
How is it?

100
07:47.640 --> 07:50.940
The umami flavour is incredible.

101
07:52.180 --> 07:53.910
And this sea bream is from Wando, right?

102
07:54.180 --> 07:56.880
- It was brought up at dawn today. - All right.

103
07:57.520 --> 08:00.150
Delicious. Truly. We discovered a wonderful restaurant.

104
08:01.690 --> 08:03.120
It is so refreshing.

105
08:04.160 --> 08:06.490
Are you starting a live stream?

106
08:08.660 --> 08:11.870
Hello, everyone. Today, on a friend's recommendation,

107
08:11.930 --> 08:14.130
I am trying a very special dish.

108
08:14.530 --> 08:19.240
It is the red sea bream capellini from a restaurant called Dasolo.

109
08:20.540 --> 08:23.080
They say this sea bream is from Wando.

110
08:24.710 --> 08:26.280
Chairman Oh's complexion looks better...

111
08:26.350 --> 08:27.650
since he started streaming.

112
08:29.420 --> 08:30.620
Is that going well?

113
08:31.780 --> 08:34.150
His channel is wildly popular.

114
08:34.220 --> 08:37.620
- Oh, really? - Young folks are crazy about it.

115
08:37.620 --> 08:38.860
Not long ago,

116
08:39.290 --> 08:41.930
he got that Gold badge.

117
08:45.270 --> 08:47.470
The savoury fat brings out the flavour...

118
08:47.530 --> 08:51.470
and the chewiness of the sea bream with the bounce of the capellini...

119
08:51.970 --> 08:53.470
The combination is...

120
08:53.540 --> 08:54.770
Wait, hold on.

121
08:55.480 --> 08:57.240
Just turn it toward me? Okay.

122
08:57.540 --> 08:59.550
Excuse me for cutting into the stream.

123
08:59.780 --> 09:02.620
I am Jang Hoon Tae,

124
09:02.680 --> 09:05.120
the one who recommended Dasolo today.

125
09:05.490 --> 09:07.920
I am the CEO of Sunghwa Apparel.

126
09:08.050 --> 09:12.590
I believe Chairman Oh is exaggerating a bit today,

127
09:12.690 --> 09:14.230
so let me give you my honest opinion.

128
09:14.530 --> 09:16.600
This place's capellini is...

129
09:17.760 --> 09:19.630
simply terrible. Yes.

130
09:20.500 --> 09:21.500
What the...

131
09:21.570 --> 09:24.140
I also have various experiences living abroad,

132
09:24.200 --> 09:25.840
and I have quite a discerning palate myself,

133
09:26.040 --> 09:28.440
so let me say this once more.

134
09:29.140 --> 09:32.850
This place is a mess. Yes, I really do not recommend it.

135
09:33.310 --> 09:35.520
You really do not need to come here.

136
09:36.450 --> 09:41.050
Yes, just never, ever come here.

137
09:50.600 --> 09:51.830
Mu Jin,

138
09:53.000 --> 09:54.630
why are you shaking so much?

139
09:58.710 --> 10:00.340
It is okay. You did great.

140
10:01.010 --> 10:04.580
You could not have done any better. You did so, so well, Mu Jin.

141
10:06.610 --> 10:07.610
Thank you.

142
10:36.440 --> 10:40.250
The score is 4.8 out of 5. The 0.2-point deduction was for...

143
10:40.510 --> 10:44.750
Jang Seo Hyun's serving mistake after she was thrown in.

144
10:51.390 --> 10:55.730
- Gyu Rim, are you okay? - The tension just suddenly left me.

145
11:00.930 --> 11:02.040
I kept my promise.

146
11:03.270 --> 11:04.670
See? I won.

147
11:07.970 --> 11:09.040
Yes, it is simply terrible.

148
11:09.480 --> 11:12.610
I also have various experiences living abroad,

149
11:12.680 --> 11:14.510
and I have quite a discerning palate myself,

150
11:15.250 --> 11:16.520
so let me say this once more.

151
11:17.120 --> 11:18.320
This place is a mess.

152
11:19.120 --> 11:21.120
Yes, I really do not recommend it.

153
11:21.720 --> 11:24.360
You really do not need to come here.

154
11:24.890 --> 11:28.290
Yes, just never, ever come here.

155
11:28.830 --> 11:30.530
Right, there is no need to visit. Yes.

156
11:30.600 --> 11:31.660
What are you doing?

157
11:32.970 --> 11:36.040
Hey, are you scared too many people will come to your regular spot?

158
11:36.440 --> 11:39.670
Yes, I want this place to myself. What about it?

159
11:40.040 --> 11:41.940
Hey, once it airs, people will swarm in,

160
11:42.010 --> 11:43.180
and it will be chaotic.

161
11:43.240 --> 11:46.250
Then my private hideout will be gone, won't it?

162
11:46.910 --> 11:48.480
You are on the air.

163
11:49.480 --> 11:50.480
(I am definitely going.)

164
11:50.780 --> 11:51.920
Is this on the air right now?

165
11:52.520 --> 11:53.590
Seriously.

166
11:54.250 --> 11:56.960
Well, it is fine if you come,

167
11:57.390 --> 12:00.130
just please do not spread the word. Yes, I am begging you.

168
12:00.560 --> 12:02.300
- Do not spread the word. - Come on over.

169
12:02.360 --> 12:03.730
Stop it. Please do not spread the word.

170
12:03.730 --> 12:05.770
- I am begging you. - Okay.

171
12:06.830 --> 12:08.330
What on earth is he doing?

172
12:10.600 --> 12:14.310
Why is he lying? Since when is he a regular?

173
12:15.510 --> 12:17.510
He knew Mu Jin's restaurant was struggling,

174
12:17.680 --> 12:19.150
so he probably wanted to help out.

175
12:20.280 --> 12:23.320
He sure loves to stick his nose into everything.

176
12:23.880 --> 12:25.120
Who does he think he is?

177
12:25.420 --> 12:26.990
After throwing away a 40-year friendship,

178
12:27.050 --> 12:28.050
who does he think he is?

179
12:38.400 --> 12:39.400
Who am I?

180
12:40.300 --> 12:41.570
Where am I?

181
12:44.170 --> 12:45.240
Good job, kiddo.

182
12:46.610 --> 12:48.440
I told you I am not middle schooler Jang Seo Hyun anymore.

183
12:50.240 --> 12:51.280
Sorry.

184
12:52.110 --> 12:53.110
Really sorry.

185
12:54.180 --> 12:58.150
What do you take me for, seriously? Who ruffles a girl's hair like that?

186
12:58.280 --> 13:00.650
Am I your military recruit? Do you think I'm that easy?

187
13:00.950 --> 13:02.590
You're definitely not easy.

188
13:03.320 --> 13:05.490
There was a time when just looking at you made me so nervous...

189
13:05.490 --> 13:07.330
and made my heart race.

190
13:07.990 --> 13:09.300
What are you talking about now?

191
13:09.530 --> 13:12.030
Didn't I tell you? When I first met you.

192
13:15.840 --> 13:18.640
I thought to myself, "How can a girl be so charming?"

193
13:19.840 --> 13:21.410
It was love at first sight.

194
13:23.110 --> 13:24.310
You never told me that.

195
13:26.680 --> 13:28.080
I guess I only said it in my head.

196
13:28.250 --> 13:31.920
It was right after I realised you were head over heels for Mu Jin.

197
13:34.120 --> 13:37.320
Still, you could have said something.

198
13:38.790 --> 13:40.790
Why bother?

199
13:42.400 --> 13:44.330
Once I saw you liked Mu Jin,

200
13:44.430 --> 13:45.970
my feelings vanished in less than a day.

201
13:45.970 --> 13:47.030
Why would I bring it up?

202
13:52.640 --> 13:53.770
What is with that look?

203
13:55.040 --> 13:58.540
Anyone watching would think you have feelings for me.

204
14:00.050 --> 14:01.050
Are you insane?

205
14:08.720 --> 14:10.060
By the way,

206
14:10.420 --> 14:13.060
that woman working as kitchen help, you should really pay her well.

207
14:13.390 --> 14:14.760
She pushes herself so hard.

208
14:16.560 --> 14:18.600
She treats the place like it's her own.

209
14:18.700 --> 14:19.700
Don't be stingy...

210
14:19.770 --> 14:23.000
- and give her a generous bonus. - Kitchen help? Who, Gyu Rim?

211
14:24.570 --> 14:25.570
Gyu Rim?

212
14:26.840 --> 14:27.840
Han Gyu Rim...

213
14:29.240 --> 14:30.280
Han Gyu Rim?

214
14:32.510 --> 14:34.380
Yes, I just got home.

215
14:36.480 --> 14:37.480
Thank you,

216
14:38.420 --> 14:39.420
my Guardian Angel.

217
14:45.660 --> 14:47.590
Don't worry about anything.

218
14:48.930 --> 14:50.130
Get some good rest tonight.

219
14:51.100 --> 14:52.630
I'm going to take a shower and head straight to bed.

220
14:54.400 --> 14:55.400
Sleep well.

221
14:56.340 --> 14:57.400
See you in my dreams.

222
14:58.340 --> 14:59.340
Good night.

223
15:00.240 --> 15:01.240
Good night.

224
15:08.650 --> 15:10.280
Get up, Kim Mu Jin. Wake up.

225
15:10.780 --> 15:12.950
I went to bed at four in the morning.

226
15:13.450 --> 15:17.320
Dinner is fully booked tonight. Every single table is reserved.

227
15:19.890 --> 15:20.930
What are you talking about?

228
15:21.560 --> 15:22.560
Say that again.

229
15:24.200 --> 15:26.530
It's been exactly one week since Chairman Jang visited.

230
15:27.230 --> 15:28.270
Can you believe this?

231
15:28.800 --> 15:32.240
We've never had 100 percent of our tables booked before.

232
15:32.840 --> 15:34.070
Our reservation rate for the next month...

233
15:34.140 --> 15:35.570
is already over 70 percent.

234
15:35.880 --> 15:36.880
No way.

235
15:37.310 --> 15:38.580
Anyway, we get a fresh start.

236
15:45.250 --> 15:48.390
We don't have to close the restaurant anymore.

237
15:48.960 --> 15:50.660
Guess I don't have to go dive for abalone after all.

238
15:52.730 --> 15:54.190
I should let Gyu Rim know.

239
15:55.960 --> 15:59.400
Gyu Rim day and night. Is she all you think about?

240
15:59.830 --> 16:03.740
Can't you share this excitement with the guy right in front of you?

241
16:03.870 --> 16:04.870
Fine, dude.

242
16:06.210 --> 16:07.370
Right, man.

243
16:07.540 --> 16:08.740
They say lovers are contract workers,

244
16:08.810 --> 16:10.940
but friends are permanent employees.

245
16:11.340 --> 16:13.080
Who says that?

246
16:14.010 --> 16:15.180
What kind of ridiculous saying is that?

247
16:15.680 --> 16:16.680
It's a thing.

248
16:16.850 --> 16:18.320
If a lover gets upset, you have to soothe them,

249
16:18.380 --> 16:20.590
but if a friend gets upset, you just buy them a meal and it's over.

250
16:20.650 --> 16:21.690
There's also a saying for that.

251
16:21.990 --> 16:25.260
With lovers, you waste so much time and emotion,

252
16:25.320 --> 16:28.260
- but with friends... - Fine. I'll buy you a meal, buddy.

253
16:28.960 --> 16:31.130
That's not what I mean. A friend is just that...

254
16:31.200 --> 16:32.830
I'll buy you a really expensive meal.

255
16:35.670 --> 16:37.270
Hey, Gyu Rim. Are you awake?

256
16:40.040 --> 16:42.210
Whatever. Go spend the rest of your life...

257
16:42.380 --> 16:43.840
obsessed with Gyu Rim.

258
16:46.410 --> 16:47.650
Wait, that's not much of a curse.

259
16:53.820 --> 16:55.120
That's amazing.

260
16:57.190 --> 16:59.230
Mu Jin is really in a league of his own.

261
16:59.530 --> 17:00.890
I'm so happy for you, Gyu Rim.

262
17:01.460 --> 17:04.130
You worked so hard too, Gyu Min. Thank you.

263
17:04.400 --> 17:06.700
You had it way harder than me.

264
17:09.270 --> 17:10.840
Is Mu Jin doing all right now?

265
17:12.640 --> 17:13.840
You took your eye patch off.

266
17:14.210 --> 17:15.470
Is your eye infection completely gone?

267
17:15.640 --> 17:18.340
Yes, of course. It's been a whole week.

268
17:19.010 --> 17:20.010
Let me see.

269
17:21.380 --> 17:22.950
Are you sure it's completely fine?

270
17:23.250 --> 17:25.950
I'm telling you, it is 100 percent fine.

271
17:26.050 --> 17:27.720
Don't worry, Gyu Rim.

272
17:27.790 --> 17:29.420
You know Gyu Seo heals like a monster.

273
17:30.660 --> 17:32.160
He's practically a zombie.

274
17:33.360 --> 17:36.130
Don't get sick, Gyu Seo. It upsets me.

275
17:36.200 --> 17:37.200
Okay.

276
17:37.660 --> 17:40.100
If you catch pink eye one more time, I'll kill you.

277
17:41.230 --> 17:42.230
Hey.

278
17:43.970 --> 17:46.070
Gyu Rim, can we talk for a second?

279
17:53.710 --> 17:54.910
You got married?

280
17:59.320 --> 18:00.590
To Gyeol's teacher?

281
18:02.350 --> 18:03.860
We're registering our marriage today.

282
18:05.560 --> 18:07.460
Could you sign as a witness?

283
18:14.030 --> 18:15.200
You're caught off guard, aren't you?

284
18:16.200 --> 18:18.800
I know this is sudden, but...

285
18:23.480 --> 18:25.010
That's just how it happened. I'm sorry.

286
18:25.680 --> 18:27.050
Please try to understand.

287
18:29.620 --> 18:32.150
Well, you're both adults,

288
18:34.890 --> 18:36.460
and I'm sure you had your reasons.

289
18:39.390 --> 18:41.430
Did you tell Hee Na's parents?

290
18:42.130 --> 18:43.130
No, not yet.

291
18:43.460 --> 18:44.630
Hee Na said she would handle it.

292
18:44.700 --> 18:45.700
She asked me to leave it to her.

293
18:47.730 --> 18:50.070
Still, I'd feel better...

294
18:50.200 --> 18:52.000
if you didn't wait too long to tell them.

295
18:53.270 --> 18:54.270
I'll make sure of it.

296
18:59.680 --> 19:00.950
Aren't you going to congratulate me?

297
19:01.380 --> 19:02.410
Right.

298
19:03.680 --> 19:06.420
Congratulations, Gyu Oh. I'm happy for you.

299
19:07.120 --> 19:09.220
You need to stand by Hee Na no matter what...

300
19:10.290 --> 19:12.460
and make her happy. Understood?

301
19:14.630 --> 19:17.300
That's why I'm getting married, of course.

302
19:19.530 --> 19:21.400
Okay, then that's all that matters.

303
19:22.700 --> 19:23.740
That's good enough.

304
19:25.840 --> 19:28.040
We rushed Gyu Young out the door without preparation,

305
19:28.540 --> 19:29.740
so for you,

306
19:29.740 --> 19:32.380
I really wanted to give you a proper send-off.

307
19:34.010 --> 19:35.450
This is all new to me too.

308
19:37.420 --> 19:39.650
I'm sorry, Gyu Oh. It's my first time handling this.

309
19:46.190 --> 19:48.090
Why do you have such terrible luck, Gyu Rim?

310
19:48.530 --> 19:51.830
Not a single one of your siblings is normal.

311
19:54.130 --> 19:55.600
Like I'm normal?

312
19:58.940 --> 20:00.570
By the way,

313
20:01.770 --> 20:03.880
have you heard from Gyu Young?

314
20:05.910 --> 20:09.720
They say this helps prevent dementia, you know?

315
20:10.480 --> 20:14.050
- She has amnesia, not dementia. - Dementia or amnesia,

316
20:14.120 --> 20:15.290
it is all the same crap.

317
20:17.090 --> 20:19.960
Besides, Go-Stop being good for preventing dementia...

318
20:20.030 --> 20:22.800
has zero scientific evidence behind it.

319
20:23.000 --> 20:24.900
Science, my foot.

320
20:25.000 --> 20:27.370
Go season your science with sesame oil...

321
20:27.430 --> 20:29.700
and eat it when you have no side dishes.

322
20:33.640 --> 20:35.040
Are you paying attention?

323
20:35.110 --> 20:37.340
I am practically bending over backward...

324
20:37.410 --> 20:38.580
doing everything I can for you.

325
20:39.480 --> 20:41.010
Now, look here.

326
20:41.080 --> 20:43.820
Look at these right here. Take a look at this.

327
20:44.350 --> 20:48.650
These are birds. When you get...

328
20:48.720 --> 20:52.320
five birds like this, that is five points.

329
20:52.590 --> 20:56.560
And then, you have Blue Ribbons, Red Ribbons,

330
20:56.660 --> 21:00.400
and these Grass Ribbons here. See?

331
21:01.770 --> 21:06.970
Why does she look like a dazed donkey choked on gas...

332
21:06.970 --> 21:08.610
all week long?

333
21:08.910 --> 21:12.110
She is not interested at all.

334
21:12.340 --> 21:15.750
If you really want to play Go-Stop with her,

335
21:16.520 --> 21:18.780
let us play for cash, 100 won a point.

336
21:19.450 --> 21:20.450
Money?

337
21:21.120 --> 21:22.790
Should we play for money?

338
21:29.660 --> 21:32.770
Wait, how many "Go"s was that? Five Go?

339
21:33.100 --> 21:34.300
Then how many...

340
21:34.500 --> 21:35.770
How many points is that?

341
21:35.870 --> 21:37.940
- I shook my cards earlier. - Shook...

342
21:39.540 --> 21:41.910
What is with this girl? Is she a card sharp?

343
21:43.410 --> 21:45.410
Did she get her senses back?

344
21:47.850 --> 21:49.780
Gyu Young has always been a material girl...

345
21:49.850 --> 21:51.980
who goes crazy over money.

346
21:53.190 --> 21:57.360
She used to be so smart, so her mind must be swinging...

347
21:57.420 --> 21:58.960
between extremes right now.

348
21:59.790 --> 22:01.630
I need to use the bathroom.

349
22:02.660 --> 22:04.030
Wait...

350
22:04.100 --> 22:05.330
This...

351
22:07.230 --> 22:08.300
Heung Sik.

352
22:08.800 --> 22:13.340
Should I take her to Jeongseon and hit the casino?

353
22:14.410 --> 22:16.010
- Jeongseon? - Yes.

354
22:16.380 --> 22:21.180
Oh, right. How are your haemorrhoids? Are they all healed up?

355
22:21.680 --> 22:24.050
It has been a week. How does it feel?

356
22:24.420 --> 22:25.420
Hey, if you sit like that...

357
22:25.480 --> 22:26.820
Hey, sit right here.

358
22:27.550 --> 22:28.750
Hold on a second.

359
22:40.130 --> 22:42.600
Han Gyu Young. If you keep testing my patience,

360
22:42.670 --> 22:46.270
I will go after your family one by one instead.

361
22:46.710 --> 22:49.170
Come home while I am asking nicely.

362
22:49.680 --> 22:52.080
Darn it, that total psychopath.

363
22:54.550 --> 22:57.420
Kang Sung Wook. Just you dare touch my family.

364
22:57.620 --> 22:59.820
I swear I will tear you to pieces and drink you up.

365
22:59.890 --> 23:01.820
(Kang Sung Wook! Touch my family, and I'll grind you and drink you!)

366
23:03.660 --> 23:04.860
Darn it.

367
23:15.200 --> 23:17.500
My mom is really getting old.

368
23:18.740 --> 23:20.270
I cannot believe she fell...

369
23:20.340 --> 23:23.480
for such terrible, clumsy acting without suspecting a thing.

370
23:25.580 --> 23:27.980
- What is with the rose? - This?

371
23:28.050 --> 23:29.820
I was carrying Mom's stuff for her...

372
23:29.880 --> 23:31.550
and just picked it up off the street.

373
23:31.880 --> 23:32.890
Why?

374
23:34.220 --> 23:35.220
Do you want it?

375
23:37.120 --> 23:40.030
If you bought it for me, just say you bought it.

376
23:40.090 --> 23:41.290
Who picks up a flower off the street?

377
23:41.730 --> 23:43.800
Why would I be crazy enough to buy you flowers?

378
23:44.930 --> 23:46.770
I even took a picture. Look, see?

379
23:48.000 --> 23:49.030
Look at the street. Can you not see...

380
23:49.100 --> 23:51.500
all the roses spilling over out there?

381
23:52.170 --> 23:53.510
Why did you even take a photo...

382
23:56.940 --> 23:57.940
What?

383
23:58.510 --> 24:00.080
Still no word from Sung Wook?

384
24:00.850 --> 24:02.280
That psychopath...

385
24:04.620 --> 24:05.620
Never mind.

386
24:06.520 --> 24:08.890
You will just get worked up, go confront him,

387
24:08.950 --> 24:11.560
- and cause more trouble. - Wait, what is it?

388
24:12.460 --> 24:14.360
Did that punk show up near our place again?

389
24:14.430 --> 24:17.030
Drop it. I will handle my own business.

390
24:20.570 --> 24:22.840
If people keep receiving favours, they start taking them for granted.

391
24:23.240 --> 24:25.440
So stop doing me any more favours.

392
24:26.740 --> 24:28.340
I am an ungrateful creature.

393
24:29.480 --> 24:32.410
You seem really bent out of shape over what Chairman Jang said,

394
24:33.080 --> 24:35.610
but not a single word he said was wrong.

395
24:35.610 --> 24:36.950
Did I say it was?

396
24:37.720 --> 24:41.120
Just stop doing favours for an ungrateful stray like me.

397
24:41.820 --> 24:43.890
I am not taking help from anyone anymore.

398
24:51.130 --> 24:52.160
(Chairman Jang Hoon Tae)

399
24:52.230 --> 24:53.630
I am sorry, Mr. Jang.

400
24:54.230 --> 24:56.200
I told Mom everything.

401
24:56.840 --> 25:00.010
Coming to see you, asking you for help...

402
25:00.070 --> 25:01.470
I told her all of it.

403
25:02.610 --> 25:03.980
I am so sorry.

404
25:04.580 --> 25:05.580
No, it is okay.

405
25:05.910 --> 25:07.780
You did nothing wrong, and there is no need to apologize.

406
25:07.850 --> 25:08.850
You did the right thing.

407
25:09.780 --> 25:11.280
All right, I understand.

408
25:12.150 --> 25:13.150
Hold on a second.

409
25:13.620 --> 25:15.650
Hey, I think your mom is already barging in.

410
25:16.320 --> 25:19.990
Do not worry, I will handle it. Yes, all right, bye.

411
25:22.960 --> 25:23.960
Yes?

412
25:24.230 --> 25:25.800
Chairman Hong is here.

413
25:26.530 --> 25:28.430
- Well... - Hey.

414
25:29.130 --> 25:30.940
Are you picking a fight with me or what?

415
25:32.940 --> 25:34.570
You are not in your right mind right now.

416
25:35.170 --> 25:37.140
I do not talk to people who are not thinking clearly,

417
25:37.210 --> 25:39.110
- so just leave for today. - Why, you...

418
25:41.380 --> 25:42.380
Actually, no.

419
25:44.020 --> 25:45.820
You are coming to the hospital with me.

420
25:46.220 --> 25:48.620
What you need right now is counselling.

421
25:48.790 --> 25:50.890
I will go with you, so let us go. Come on.

422
25:50.960 --> 25:52.890
Let go. Let go of me.

423
25:53.460 --> 25:55.190
Who do you think you are?

424
25:55.290 --> 25:57.460
Who are you to interfere in someone else's family business?

425
25:57.530 --> 25:58.830
Do you really have nothing better to do?

426
25:59.430 --> 26:01.870
It is not someone else's business. It is my daughter's.

427
26:02.300 --> 26:04.740
- What? - Gyu Rim is my daughter.

428
26:05.640 --> 26:07.110
How could you pull such a crazy stunt...

429
26:07.170 --> 26:08.510
just to tear Mu Jin and Gyu Rim apart?

430
26:09.040 --> 26:10.040
Hey.

431
26:10.110 --> 26:11.280
If I did not know, that would be one thing,

432
26:11.340 --> 26:13.180
but now that I do, do you expect me to just sit by?

433
26:13.950 --> 26:16.420
Hey. Hey...

434
26:16.480 --> 26:17.880
How on earth is she your daughter?

435
26:18.750 --> 26:20.290
Have you even met Han Gyu Rim?

436
26:20.450 --> 26:22.550
Has she ever once called you "Father"?

437
26:22.650 --> 26:24.560
You lived for 33 years without even knowing what she looks like,

438
26:24.620 --> 26:26.060
so what kind of nonsense is this?

439
26:26.120 --> 26:28.160
What on earth is wrong with you? Really.

440
26:29.230 --> 26:30.360
How did you end up like this?

441
26:30.930 --> 26:32.970
Why do you keep being so stubborn and unreasonable,

442
26:32.970 --> 26:34.900
throwing tantrums like a petulant child?

443
26:36.270 --> 26:37.970
Where did it all go wrong for you?

444
26:38.840 --> 26:40.310
Ok Seon, please.

445
26:40.440 --> 26:43.380
If you are wrong, just admit you are wrong.

446
26:43.940 --> 26:45.110
If your brakes are broken,

447
26:45.180 --> 26:47.050
you should grip the wheel and try to stop.

448
26:47.110 --> 26:49.010
Why do you keep stepping on the gas?

449
26:49.080 --> 26:50.480
How far are you planning to take this?

450
26:50.550 --> 26:52.080
At the end of this road is a brick wall and a cliff...

451
26:52.150 --> 26:53.150
You little!

452
26:54.850 --> 26:56.020
Look at you.

453
26:56.290 --> 26:57.760
Just look at yourself. You never used to act like this.

454
26:57.820 --> 26:58.920
Honestly.

455
26:59.630 --> 27:00.660
Listen to me.

456
27:00.760 --> 27:02.560
Did I put Mu Jin through business school...

457
27:02.630 --> 27:06.830
just to watch him end up as a chef at some pathetic little diner?

458
27:07.370 --> 27:09.600
Did I raise him like royalty...

459
27:09.670 --> 27:11.570
just so he could reject all those high-society girls...

460
27:11.640 --> 27:13.470
and end up with someone so worthless?

461
27:13.570 --> 27:17.340
- Watch your mouth. - I am going to drag Mu Jin...

462
27:17.410 --> 27:20.050
all the way down to rock bottom.

463
27:20.150 --> 27:22.880
I will make him weep tears of blood and regret everything.

464
27:23.120 --> 27:24.850
And then? Even if he has to crawl,

465
27:24.850 --> 27:27.290
I will make him come back to our company.

466
27:27.520 --> 27:28.520
Listen.

467
27:28.590 --> 27:30.920
Not as Kim Mu Jin, the local restaurant owner,

468
27:30.990 --> 27:32.760
but known to the whole world...

469
27:32.820 --> 27:35.790
as Chairman Kim Mu Jin of Dongyoon Group.

470
27:36.090 --> 27:37.400
I will make sure of it!

471
27:49.170 --> 27:50.210
Thank you.

472
28:10.300 --> 28:11.660
Hey, it is me.

473
28:12.730 --> 28:13.730
Yes.

474
28:14.770 --> 28:17.000
About that seafood delivery to Dasolo.

475
28:18.300 --> 28:19.740
Are you on your way to send it out now?

476
28:20.140 --> 28:21.540
Did they say it is for tonight's dinner?

477
28:26.780 --> 28:27.910
I heard that factory investment you made...

478
28:27.980 --> 28:28.980
went completely belly-up.

479
28:29.380 --> 28:31.350
Word is you are borrowing money everywhere.

480
28:31.350 --> 28:32.380
Is that true?

481
28:33.250 --> 28:35.350
(Dinner Special: Prepared With Fresh Oysters From Geumyeong Bay)

482
28:35.790 --> 28:38.090
Yes, I'm cooking oysters tonight.

483
28:39.420 --> 28:41.960
You love fresh oysters, Gyu Rim. Come by later and eat.

484
28:43.830 --> 28:44.860
Of course.

485
28:44.930 --> 28:46.500
The sous chef started working yesterday.

486
28:46.570 --> 28:48.300
And the assistant chefs and the staff...

487
28:48.430 --> 28:49.670
are building great chemistry.

488
28:52.100 --> 28:53.110
By the way, Gyu Rim...

489
28:54.740 --> 28:55.940
Don't you miss me?

490
28:56.580 --> 28:57.940
It has already been four days...

491
28:58.010 --> 28:59.280
since we last saw each other.

492
29:00.110 --> 29:03.920
I miss you so much that my eyes are sore from crying.

493
29:07.790 --> 29:08.790
I mean it.

494
29:12.020 --> 29:13.230
All right.

495
29:13.630 --> 29:16.030
Let us see each other after work today.

496
29:16.730 --> 29:18.530
Okay, I will call you.

497
29:21.200 --> 29:22.200
Ma'am.

498
29:22.270 --> 29:25.270
Oh, you're back from a delivery.

499
29:25.440 --> 29:26.670
Ma'am.

500
29:27.970 --> 29:28.970
Yes?

501
29:30.010 --> 29:31.080
Do you know...

502
29:31.380 --> 29:32.640
that you have been acting really strange lately?

503
29:33.780 --> 29:35.050
What do you mean?

504
29:35.380 --> 29:37.550
You get startled every time you see me,

505
29:37.980 --> 29:39.620
and you seem to avoid my eyes, too.

506
29:39.850 --> 29:43.590
Why would I be startled? I was not avoiding you.

507
29:43.920 --> 29:46.360
See? I am looking right at you like this.

508
29:48.460 --> 29:50.500
I guess I was mistaken.

509
29:50.930 --> 29:52.730
I must have missed the way you looked at me.

510
29:54.600 --> 29:55.800
Your phone is ringing.

511
29:55.870 --> 29:58.140
- Answer the phone. - Okay.

512
30:01.510 --> 30:04.340
- Hello? - Is this Han Gyu Rim?

513
30:05.210 --> 30:06.280
Yes, it is.

514
30:08.810 --> 30:10.420
My name is Jang Seo Hyun.

515
30:11.180 --> 30:13.320
I got your number from Jung Woo.

516
30:15.220 --> 30:18.120
A week ago, in the bathroom at the Dasolo restaurant,

517
30:19.260 --> 30:22.360
I put ointment on the wound on your back and put gauze on it.

518
30:23.700 --> 30:25.560
Hello.

519
30:39.510 --> 30:41.210
Is your wound okay?

520
30:41.980 --> 30:43.450
Did you go to the hospital?

521
30:44.450 --> 30:47.420
Yes, I was really grateful that day.

522
30:51.390 --> 30:52.420
By any chance...

523
30:53.830 --> 30:54.890
Jang Seo Hyun...

524
30:56.700 --> 30:58.530
Have you ever heard my name?

525
31:01.170 --> 31:02.170
No.

526
31:05.170 --> 31:08.070
I have heard a lot about you, Gyu Rim.

527
31:10.180 --> 31:11.310
About me?

528
31:17.150 --> 31:18.750
My mother's name...

529
31:21.950 --> 31:23.020
is Go Yoon Hee.

530
31:32.230 --> 31:34.570
Yes, the person you are thinking of.

531
31:36.670 --> 31:38.240
The one who gave birth to you.

532
31:39.070 --> 31:40.440
The one who raised me.

533
31:49.080 --> 31:52.520
I heard you called Mom seven years ago.

534
31:54.850 --> 31:57.120
And that you changed your number right after that.

535
32:00.430 --> 32:01.690
She told me.

536
32:03.600 --> 32:06.930
She said you called her ten years after you separated from her.

537
32:09.300 --> 32:11.000
You begged her to come just once,

538
32:12.840 --> 32:14.340
but she could not go because of me.

539
32:16.810 --> 32:18.510
She had to take care of me after my appendectomy,

540
32:20.210 --> 32:21.850
so she could not go to you.

541
32:28.190 --> 32:29.190
I think Mom...

542
32:29.920 --> 32:31.690
is going to divorce Dad.

543
32:39.500 --> 32:41.700
There is a man I like,

544
32:43.000 --> 32:44.300
and because Mom opposed it,

545
32:45.700 --> 32:47.670
I resented her and hated her so much...

546
32:48.770 --> 32:50.840
that I told her to get out of our house.

547
32:55.150 --> 32:57.220
Even when her own daughter asked for her, she chose me instead.

548
32:58.050 --> 32:59.850
I was her whole world.

549
33:01.790 --> 33:04.160
She cherished me and loved me ten thousand times more...

550
33:04.220 --> 33:05.920
than my biological mother ever did.

551
33:08.890 --> 33:11.260
How could I be so awful?

552
33:13.100 --> 33:14.770
All over some guy...

553
33:20.870 --> 33:22.710
I feel like a monster.

554
33:24.280 --> 33:26.140
Heaven will surely punish me.

555
33:30.880 --> 33:32.950
When judgment finally strikes me down,

556
33:33.590 --> 33:35.250
make sure you come and watch.

557
34:09.720 --> 34:11.160
May I blow my nose?

558
34:23.840 --> 34:26.070
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

559
34:28.810 --> 34:30.580
Here is your marinated galbi.

560
34:31.440 --> 34:33.110
Did you enjoy the sirloin?

561
34:34.080 --> 34:35.310
It was delicious.

562
34:36.110 --> 34:38.580
Thank you. Please enjoy.

563
34:50.130 --> 34:51.130
Gyu Rim.

564
34:53.300 --> 34:54.830
Gyu Young, Gyu Oh.

565
35:02.410 --> 35:03.940
Gyu Rim. Gyu Young. Gyu Oh.

566
35:09.980 --> 35:11.420
What happened to you?

567
35:13.920 --> 35:15.250
Were you starved?

568
35:17.290 --> 35:19.290
Did you not get proper meals?

569
35:21.890 --> 35:23.390
Did your stepmother mistreat you?

570
35:24.960 --> 35:27.130
Did she not even feed you properly?

571
35:31.600 --> 35:32.800
Come inside and eat.

572
35:33.970 --> 35:35.470
Mom will grill meat for you.

573
35:37.410 --> 35:40.250
Mom will grill some delicious meat for you.

574
36:27.630 --> 36:29.260
What on earth did you do to my children?

575
36:30.230 --> 36:31.830
Did you feed them properly?

576
36:32.530 --> 36:33.870
Did you dress them well?

577
36:34.900 --> 36:37.600
Did you take proper care of them while they worked hard at school?

578
36:37.970 --> 36:39.900
Did you treat them differently from your own children?

579
36:41.710 --> 36:43.910
You didn't give birth to them, so you should have treated them better.

580
36:44.880 --> 36:45.880
You didn't carry them,

581
36:45.940 --> 36:49.680
so you should have cherished them, loved them, and cared for them more.

582
36:51.050 --> 36:52.520
Children without their mother...

583
36:53.350 --> 36:56.290
You should have doted on them out of pity...

584
36:56.390 --> 36:59.890
and worn yourself to the bone to give them everything.

585
37:00.390 --> 37:03.360
That is why I gave up my place as their mother...

586
37:03.490 --> 37:05.260
and stepped down as a wife.

587
37:06.000 --> 37:07.400
My ears hurt.

588
37:08.230 --> 37:09.630
Let me...

589
37:10.000 --> 37:11.100
Let me talk.

590
37:11.170 --> 37:12.240
Are you firing a machine gun?

591
37:14.140 --> 37:18.510
I never discriminated between your kids and mine.

592
37:18.580 --> 37:21.580
I neglected them all equally, so what of it?

593
37:22.050 --> 37:25.020
What right do you have to yell at me like you did such a wonderful job?

594
37:25.780 --> 37:27.620
Cutting off all contact for 17 years...

595
37:27.690 --> 37:29.850
without even calling once. Are you even a mother?

596
37:30.120 --> 37:33.890
You have no right to act like this. You have no right to question me.

597
37:34.860 --> 37:37.860
Look who's talking. The pot is calling the kettle black.

598
37:42.230 --> 37:45.600
I never should have given her my number.

599
37:46.040 --> 37:47.140
Completely useless.

600
38:16.530 --> 38:17.970
The udon is really good here.

601
38:19.270 --> 38:21.040
Eating something will make you feel better.

602
38:24.910 --> 38:27.910
My mom told me we're the same age.

603
38:28.710 --> 38:30.580
Really? We are?

604
38:30.820 --> 38:31.820
Yet...

605
38:31.880 --> 38:33.150
you seem so much more mature.

606
38:33.750 --> 38:35.250
I feel like an elementary schooler next to you.

607
38:36.650 --> 38:38.890
I guess that is because...

608
38:38.960 --> 38:40.660
I have already been through hell and back.

609
38:42.530 --> 38:43.530
Thank you.

610
38:51.870 --> 38:52.870
Eat up.

611
38:58.380 --> 39:00.710
I think I get why Mu Jin...

612
39:01.450 --> 39:02.780
likes you so much.

613
39:05.980 --> 39:09.720
I am not that close to him,

614
39:10.760 --> 39:12.020
but I know him a bit.

615
39:13.860 --> 39:16.190
Still, I have heard so much about you.

616
39:36.210 --> 39:38.480
Back then, seven years ago,

617
39:40.520 --> 39:44.260
may I ask why you called my mom?

618
40:09.810 --> 40:11.180
My baby died.

619
40:13.520 --> 40:14.620
Right after being born,

620
40:16.020 --> 40:17.760
without even seeing his mother's face...

621
40:18.860 --> 40:21.190
or saying goodbye.

622
40:29.070 --> 40:31.170
As I held my baby's cold body,

623
40:33.370 --> 40:36.070
I suddenly missed my mom.

624
40:39.080 --> 40:40.480
I wished I could just rest for a moment...

625
40:40.580 --> 40:42.610
in my mom's warm embrace.

626
40:43.150 --> 40:44.820
That is why I called.

627
41:19.180 --> 41:20.420
Is this special treatment?

628
41:20.920 --> 41:23.350
Totally. During break time,

629
41:23.520 --> 41:26.360
I cooked for you myself and served you myself.

630
41:26.420 --> 41:29.230
Not even the president gets this kind of service.

631
41:30.800 --> 41:32.900
- Thank you for the food. - Hold on.

632
41:39.970 --> 41:40.970
Enjoy.

633
41:44.380 --> 41:45.380
Mister.

634
41:46.040 --> 41:47.040
Yes?

635
41:47.910 --> 41:51.020
When I grow up, I want to be a good grown-up,

636
41:51.420 --> 41:53.220
just like you and Mom.

637
41:55.220 --> 41:56.850
I still have a long way to go.

638
41:58.020 --> 42:00.120
You just focus on being like your mom.

639
42:00.730 --> 42:03.530
She is my role model, too.

640
42:03.790 --> 42:04.800
Okay.

641
42:06.560 --> 42:07.600
Oh, by the way,

642
42:08.370 --> 42:10.300
Grandpa told me to ask you something...

643
42:10.370 --> 42:12.340
- when I saw you. - Yes?

644
42:12.400 --> 42:15.340
When do I get to be Kim Gyeol?

645
42:18.540 --> 42:19.680
I wonder about that, too.

646
42:20.550 --> 42:24.180
I want that even more than world peace.

647
42:25.450 --> 42:28.050
When we see your mom later, the three of us should...

648
42:28.250 --> 42:29.490
have a serious talk about it.

649
42:29.920 --> 42:30.920
Okay.

650
42:52.780 --> 42:55.480
(Mom)

651
42:58.420 --> 42:59.420
Mom.

652
43:01.490 --> 43:03.020
How is Father doing?

653
43:04.560 --> 43:05.560
What about my brother?

654
43:09.060 --> 43:10.060
That is a relief.

655
43:10.930 --> 43:12.360
Rehab exercises...

656
43:12.500 --> 43:13.930
are the most important thing, you know?

657
43:14.700 --> 43:16.470
Make sure he never skips them.

658
43:24.240 --> 43:25.240
And Mom,

659
43:28.350 --> 43:29.410
you trust me, right?

660
43:34.050 --> 43:38.290
Whatever choice your daughter makes, whatever decision,

661
43:39.520 --> 43:40.690
you trust me no matter what, right?

662
43:45.500 --> 43:46.630
Then that is all that matters.

663
43:48.600 --> 43:50.530
As long as you trust me, everything is fine.

664
43:56.140 --> 44:00.080
There is this man I don't ever want to lose,

665
44:00.880 --> 44:02.580
and I think I want to hold on to him tight.

666
44:03.810 --> 44:06.050
I am scared someone else will steal him away.

667
44:08.050 --> 44:09.620
So I am going to hold on tight.

668
44:15.590 --> 44:18.000
(All For You)

669
44:18.060 --> 44:19.700
- Yes. - Here is our store card.

670
44:20.160 --> 44:22.600
- Yes. - Thank you. Have a nice day.

671
44:23.830 --> 44:26.340
Su Chan says he'll watch the store, so not to worry and just go.

672
44:28.240 --> 44:29.240
All right.

673
44:31.280 --> 44:32.810
I'll leave in ten minutes.

674
44:33.380 --> 44:34.580
Wait.

675
44:36.550 --> 44:38.350
Let's meet in front of the district office in an hour.

676
44:41.050 --> 44:42.850
Yes, sounds good. Okay.

677
44:45.220 --> 44:46.220
Hey, Su Chan.

678
44:46.220 --> 44:48.330
Hee Na says she's forever grateful, and wanted me to tell you.

679
44:54.000 --> 44:55.000
Hey, Gyu Oh.

680
44:56.330 --> 44:57.600
Yoon Gi just sent me...

681
44:58.600 --> 45:01.440
this link. Take a look at this.

682
45:02.240 --> 45:03.240
What is it?

683
45:07.980 --> 45:09.810
Who the heck would post something like this?

684
45:10.880 --> 45:12.350
Anyone come to mind?

685
45:38.640 --> 45:41.280
I heard you married that con artist gigolo. Is that true?

686
45:41.280 --> 45:44.880
Knowing full well he is a criminal, you still fooled around with him?

687
45:45.150 --> 45:46.550
And on top of that, you married him?

688
45:47.050 --> 45:48.850
A schoolteacher, someone who should set an example...

689
45:48.850 --> 45:50.250
for others, acting like this.

690
45:51.260 --> 45:53.760
You look so innocent on the outside.

691
45:54.260 --> 45:55.460
Does your school know?

692
45:55.890 --> 45:57.290
Do the parents know?

693
45:58.960 --> 46:01.470
From a deceitful witch like you,

694
46:01.530 --> 46:04.540
what could young, growing minds possibly learn?

695
46:12.140 --> 46:13.940
(Principal)

696
46:18.220 --> 46:19.450
Yes, Principal.

697
46:21.290 --> 46:22.290
Yes.

698
46:22.820 --> 46:24.790
I'm on my way out right now.

699
46:26.420 --> 46:27.420
Right now?

700
46:28.560 --> 46:31.260
I have something urgent to take care of.

701
46:37.770 --> 46:40.200
Yes, it's true I got married,

702
46:41.340 --> 46:42.670
but that's not true...

703
47:23.650 --> 47:24.650
Darn it.

704
47:30.890 --> 47:31.890
My gosh.

705
47:36.490 --> 47:38.760
- Can I come in? - Don't come in.

706
47:39.100 --> 47:40.100
I'm coming in.

707
47:40.660 --> 47:41.830
Darn it.

708
47:43.430 --> 47:45.100
What happened? Did you fall off the bed?

709
47:46.340 --> 47:47.440
Darn it.

710
47:48.510 --> 47:52.280
Why is this bed so small? Rich people sleep on king-size beds...

711
47:52.340 --> 47:53.410
even when they sleep alone.

712
47:53.910 --> 47:55.050
Are you broke or something?

713
47:55.280 --> 47:57.150
Well, how would an unemployed bum have money?

714
47:57.380 --> 47:58.850
Should I buy you a king-size bed?

715
48:00.050 --> 48:02.590
Now you're picking fights over someone else's bed?

716
48:03.290 --> 48:04.820
At this rate, you're about to lose your mind...

717
48:04.890 --> 48:06.620
any day now.

718
48:07.990 --> 48:10.730
My head is literally going to explode...

719
48:10.730 --> 48:12.100
and drive me crazy, so if I actually lose it,

720
48:12.160 --> 48:13.830
just dump me on some deserted island.

721
48:14.030 --> 48:15.570
So nobody finds out I've gone crazy.

722
48:16.770 --> 48:19.440
Go change your clothes. Let's go get some fresh air.

723
48:20.040 --> 48:22.640
Forget it. I'm scared of seeing people.

724
48:23.740 --> 48:24.740
We'll just make sure...

725
48:24.810 --> 48:26.240
no one recognises you as Han Gyu Young.

726
48:26.310 --> 48:29.410
How could they not? Even in jeans and a cheap T-shirt,

727
48:29.480 --> 48:32.380
my face practically glows. All the guys stare at me.

728
48:32.480 --> 48:34.520
You really have a severe case of vanity.

729
48:40.120 --> 48:41.160
Here.

730
48:42.830 --> 48:43.830
Pretty.

731
48:47.770 --> 48:48.870
Mister.

732
48:50.900 --> 48:51.900
Darn it.

733
48:57.210 --> 48:58.210
Darn it.

734
49:00.910 --> 49:03.010
He told me to wait a moment, so why is he taking so long?

735
49:03.080 --> 49:04.680
What if Kang Sung Wook shows up?

736
49:06.420 --> 49:08.390
Go ahead and show up, you jerk.

737
49:08.720 --> 49:10.050
You are nothing but a sewer-dwelling maggot.

738
49:10.120 --> 49:11.490
Who do you think you are, threatening me?

739
49:12.560 --> 49:13.560
Darn it.

740
49:23.400 --> 49:25.300
Grandma, get in. Hurry, Grandma.

741
49:28.010 --> 49:30.440
- Mister? - Hurry up and get in.

742
49:31.880 --> 49:33.280
Seriously.

743
49:35.080 --> 49:36.850
Hey, it will be a pain if people recognise.

744
49:36.910 --> 49:37.920
Get in quickly.

745
49:37.980 --> 49:40.580
What is this? What is with this car, and what is up with your look?

746
49:40.990 --> 49:42.390
This car is mine.

747
49:42.790 --> 49:46.460
And this is my official look when I work. Satisfied? Just get in.

748
49:46.790 --> 49:47.830
- Darn it. - What are you doing?

749
49:48.330 --> 49:51.730
What are you, mister? A spy? Undercover? A shadow operative?

750
49:53.030 --> 49:55.730
And what about your mother? Is she on your team too?

751
49:55.800 --> 49:56.800
Disguised as mother and son?

752
49:56.870 --> 49:58.500
Stop letting your wild imagination run wild, and just get in.

753
49:58.570 --> 50:00.200
You will see when we get there.

754
50:00.270 --> 50:01.270
You sure talk a lot.

755
50:01.340 --> 50:03.370
Just how much dirty money did you make?

756
50:03.440 --> 50:04.910
I mean, why do you have so much money?

757
50:04.980 --> 50:05.980
Seriously.

758
50:06.480 --> 50:09.110
What kind of work? What kind of work do you do?

759
50:09.380 --> 50:10.810
It is related to national security, right?

760
50:10.880 --> 50:13.620
Why? Planning to report me and cash in on the reward?

761
50:13.920 --> 50:15.890
Just get in. You will see when we get there.

762
50:15.950 --> 50:18.190
- This girl talks too much. - No, where are we going?

763
50:18.490 --> 50:19.920
Get in. People are looking.

764
50:20.420 --> 50:21.890
Who is looking?

765
50:23.460 --> 50:25.030
Get down.

766
50:47.120 --> 50:50.390
Our model is very handsome.

767
50:51.190 --> 50:52.190
Mister.

768
50:53.620 --> 50:57.330
For today's shoot, I am photographer Joel.

769
50:58.700 --> 50:59.700
Surprised?

770
51:00.630 --> 51:02.030
Let us do a great job, Han Gyu Seo.

771
51:03.000 --> 51:04.100
I am counting on you.

772
51:05.170 --> 51:06.170
Yes, sir.

773
51:07.040 --> 51:08.140
Excuse me, boss.

774
51:08.640 --> 51:10.870
Where should we seat the guest who came with you?

775
51:12.180 --> 51:13.380
No need to cater to her.

776
51:13.680 --> 51:15.880
She will just find a corner and stay out of the way on her own.

777
51:16.810 --> 51:17.820
All right then.

778
51:19.250 --> 51:20.280
Oh my.

779
51:26.960 --> 51:28.030
All right, let us see.

780
51:32.830 --> 51:34.060
Let me just...

781
51:39.940 --> 51:43.010
Il Gook, hand it over. Let us take a look.

782
51:43.640 --> 51:44.680
All right, here is today's concept.

783
51:44.740 --> 51:45.740
Yes, sir.

784
51:46.540 --> 51:48.750
Like this...

785
51:51.150 --> 51:54.320
You will be sitting like this, and over here...

786
51:55.050 --> 51:57.290
- Are we using this product? - Yes, exactly.

787
52:27.420 --> 52:28.420
Hold on a second.

788
52:29.050 --> 52:30.090
Let us see.

789
52:31.820 --> 52:33.860
- What do you think? - It looks great.

790
52:34.160 --> 52:35.830
It is great. Look at this.

791
52:38.360 --> 52:40.100
It's so good.

792
52:41.300 --> 52:45.600
Hey, Mr. Model. Your skin looks fantastic right now,

793
52:45.800 --> 52:47.910
and honestly, you're doing great so far.

794
52:48.110 --> 52:50.540
That radiant glow from the cream,

795
52:50.710 --> 52:52.680
I really want it to pop in the picture.

796
52:52.780 --> 52:54.010
Let's do just one more take.

797
52:54.080 --> 52:55.180
- Sure. - Sounds good?

798
52:58.280 --> 52:59.280
Great.

799
53:10.730 --> 53:11.930
(Imseong Fisheries, Geumyeong Bay Oysters)

800
53:13.330 --> 53:15.070
Goodness, what am I going to do with you?

801
53:15.900 --> 53:18.670
Instead of selling them, you set aside mine first?

802
53:19.570 --> 53:20.840
These are from down in my hometown,

803
53:20.900 --> 53:22.410
- They look plump. - Geumyeong Bay oysters.

804
53:22.470 --> 53:25.010
- Yes. - I thought of you,

805
53:25.080 --> 53:26.640
so I brought a few over.

806
53:27.040 --> 53:29.680
That's not just a few. It's a whole bunch.

807
53:30.510 --> 53:32.450
Well, it's mostly because the shells are big.

808
53:32.520 --> 53:34.720
Once you shuck them, there's not that much.

809
53:34.990 --> 53:36.290
My goodness.

810
53:36.350 --> 53:38.160
When it comes to Geumyeong Bay oysters,

811
53:38.460 --> 53:40.260
they truly hit the spot.

812
53:40.960 --> 53:44.160
You see how I'm still full of so much energy?

813
53:44.430 --> 53:48.200
It's all because I ate lots of oysters in my youth.

814
53:48.470 --> 53:49.470
For me too,

815
53:50.200 --> 53:52.140
having such nice skin...

816
53:52.200 --> 53:55.170
- is all thanks to the oysters. - Of course.

817
53:56.040 --> 53:57.470
With this much,

818
53:57.540 --> 54:00.110
I can't possibly eat it all by myself.

819
54:00.680 --> 54:05.380
There's someone I really want to share them with.

820
54:05.620 --> 54:07.150
Go ahead and share as much as you like.

821
54:07.220 --> 54:08.890
They're yours now, after all.

822
54:09.950 --> 54:11.890
You see, Gyeol's Mom...

823
54:12.720 --> 54:15.260
absolutely loves oysters.

824
54:17.460 --> 54:20.100
Plus, I feel a bit guilty toward her.

825
54:22.370 --> 54:26.400
Now, if I give all of this to Gyeol's Mom,

826
54:26.800 --> 54:28.110
would you feel hurt?

827
54:29.370 --> 54:31.940
I don't mind at all.

828
54:32.110 --> 54:34.480
They're yours, so you can do whatever you want with them.

829
54:34.910 --> 54:38.580
In fact, knowing these oysters are going to Gyu Rim,

830
54:38.880 --> 54:40.580
once this guy finds out,

831
54:41.290 --> 54:45.720
he is going to be head over heels thrilled.

832
54:46.190 --> 54:47.460
Who would that be?

833
54:47.920 --> 54:49.530
My neck hurts looking up, so sit down and spill it.

834
54:49.590 --> 54:53.160
Who's going to be so thrilled?

835
54:53.660 --> 54:57.070
(Imseong Fisheries, Geumyeong Bay Oysters)

836
55:19.490 --> 55:21.360
Tell me that I'm sane.

837
55:23.490 --> 55:24.800
You are sane.

838
55:26.260 --> 55:28.130
Tell me that I'm not wrong.

839
55:28.800 --> 55:30.070
You aren't wrong.

840
55:31.170 --> 55:33.700
Tell me that I haven't gone crazy.

841
55:34.370 --> 55:35.740
You haven't gone crazy.

842
55:37.010 --> 55:38.240
How long are we going to do this?

843
55:39.080 --> 55:41.110
It's not like we're taking a listen-and-repeat test.

844
55:45.650 --> 55:47.250
What would you do if I really went crazy?

845
55:47.980 --> 55:48.990
What?

846
55:48.990 --> 55:50.520
What if I am wrong?

847
55:52.790 --> 55:55.330
- What? - If I really am wrong and crazy,

848
55:55.390 --> 55:56.690
what would you do?

849
55:59.760 --> 56:01.160
I'd still hang out with you.

850
56:03.830 --> 56:05.070
Even if you're wrong,

851
56:05.900 --> 56:07.000
even if you go crazy,

852
56:08.410 --> 56:11.640
Even if people criticise you, point fingers at you,

853
56:12.310 --> 56:13.980
and no one wants to be around you,

854
56:17.350 --> 56:18.880
I will still stick by your side.

855
56:25.220 --> 56:26.420
To be honest,

856
56:27.660 --> 56:28.860
there is something strange about you.

857
56:31.660 --> 56:34.130
You always make me want to be a better person.

858
56:35.600 --> 56:36.830
Whenever I am around you,

859
56:39.540 --> 56:41.270
I become a better man.

860
56:51.780 --> 56:52.780
You...

861
56:53.780 --> 56:55.050
You promised.

862
56:56.990 --> 56:59.620
Even if everyone badmouths me, points fingers,

863
56:59.760 --> 57:02.230
and leaves me all alone, you...

864
57:05.760 --> 57:06.760
You will...

865
57:07.360 --> 57:10.330
stay with me, right?

866
57:46.540 --> 57:49.310
Why is she spaced out like that again?

867
57:51.880 --> 57:55.310
Do not tell me she found out.

868
58:00.320 --> 58:01.750
Gyu Rim.

869
58:02.120 --> 58:05.360
- Yes, ma'am. - How did you not hear me...

870
58:05.560 --> 58:06.560
walk in?

871
58:07.290 --> 58:08.530
Is something wrong?

872
58:09.490 --> 58:11.600
No, nothing at all.

873
58:12.230 --> 58:16.500
- I am sorry. - I am the one who should be sorry.

874
58:17.230 --> 58:20.800
- Pardon? - Never mind that. Look, I...

875
58:20.870 --> 58:25.880
I brought some oysters. You are crazy about oysters, right?

876
58:25.940 --> 58:27.540
Wait, this many?

877
58:28.450 --> 58:30.480
You really did not have to give me this much...

878
58:30.550 --> 58:31.950
It turns out...

879
58:32.150 --> 58:34.220
I developed an allergy to oysters out of nowhere.

880
58:34.320 --> 58:37.520
Just looking at the box makes me itch all over.

881
58:37.950 --> 58:40.120
You eat all of this yourself, okay?

882
58:40.760 --> 58:41.960
Ma'am.

883
58:45.630 --> 58:47.660
You are the kind of person...

884
58:47.730 --> 58:50.700
who would jump out of bed for oysters, right?

885
58:51.270 --> 58:55.770
You just never made a fuss about it because you always gave them away.

886
58:56.570 --> 59:00.110
So do not share this with anyone.

887
59:00.510 --> 59:04.150
Not your father, not your siblings, and not even Gyeol.

888
59:04.510 --> 59:07.820
Eat every last bit yourself.

889
59:08.450 --> 59:09.990
I am going to check up on you.

890
59:12.290 --> 59:14.060
Did you hear me?

891
59:16.330 --> 59:18.700
Should not you have at least one thing...

892
59:19.860 --> 59:21.360
that is just for you...

893
59:21.430 --> 59:24.130
without thinking about everyone else?

894
59:27.370 --> 59:28.540
Yes.

895
59:29.140 --> 59:30.970
I will eat it all myself.

896
59:31.840 --> 59:33.810
I promise I will.

897
59:34.340 --> 59:36.150
Enjoy every bite, okay?

898
59:45.690 --> 59:46.690
Yes.

899
59:54.900 --> 59:55.900
Wait.

900
01:00:34.540 --> 01:00:35.540
Hey.

901
01:00:36.910 --> 01:00:40.080
Are these really from today's batch? I definitely tasted them earlier.

902
01:00:43.310 --> 01:00:45.220
No. We cannot serve these oysters today.

903
01:00:45.980 --> 01:00:47.620
Throw out all of today's oysters.

904
01:00:48.720 --> 01:00:49.950
Tell Park Jung Woo to come down.

905
01:00:50.190 --> 01:00:51.190
Yes, sir.

906
01:01:05.600 --> 01:01:08.200
No, no.

907
01:01:12.910 --> 01:01:16.780
Secretary An, this is wrong. Cancel everything I ordered.

908
01:01:16.850 --> 01:01:18.850
I was not in my right mind.

909
01:01:20.150 --> 01:01:24.520
I lost my mind. I have gone crazy.

910
01:01:27.620 --> 01:01:28.690
(Imseong Fisheries, Geumyeong Bay Oysters)

911
01:01:41.070 --> 01:01:43.340
What do you mean? Stop taking orders from the guests?

912
01:01:43.410 --> 01:01:45.540
Why, is there some kind of problem?

913
01:01:45.680 --> 01:01:48.380
Tell Mr. Im from Geumyeong Bay that I am going to kill him.

914
01:01:48.880 --> 01:01:50.050
Tell the guests...

915
01:01:51.850 --> 01:01:53.150
honestly that we cannot serve the oysters...

916
01:01:53.220 --> 01:01:54.420
because there is an issue with them.

917
01:01:55.190 --> 01:01:57.320
And to the guests who came specifically for the oysters,

918
01:01:57.820 --> 01:01:58.920
give them a bottle of wine...

919
01:01:59.090 --> 01:02:01.860
No, scratch that. Give every guest here today...

920
01:02:01.930 --> 01:02:04.660
- a complimentary bottle of wine. - I told you money does not grow...

921
01:02:04.730 --> 01:02:05.800
on trees, did I not?

922
01:02:06.060 --> 01:02:07.700
Do you really want to go completely broke?

923
01:02:07.760 --> 01:02:10.630
If that is your goal, just say so. There are far easier ways to do it.

924
01:02:10.630 --> 01:02:12.570
I will pay for the wine out of my own pocket,

925
01:02:12.800 --> 01:02:15.270
- so text me your nagging. - Darn it...

926
01:02:16.670 --> 01:02:18.540
A guest is asking for the CEO.

927
01:02:19.840 --> 01:02:21.240
Let us get moving for now.

928
01:02:23.810 --> 01:02:24.810
Mu Jin.

929
01:02:26.220 --> 01:02:28.750
Gyu Rim might have eaten some...

930
01:02:31.120 --> 01:02:32.320
Those oysters...

931
01:02:33.320 --> 01:02:35.130
She has them right now.

932
01:03:21.910 --> 01:03:23.910
(Love on the Menu)

933
01:03:23.910 --> 01:03:24.910
Who could it be?

934
01:03:24.910 --> 01:03:26.840
- Who would go this far against me? - Sit down.

935
01:03:26.840 --> 01:03:28.110
From now on, do not even trust me.

936
01:03:28.210 --> 01:03:31.180
- Do not trust anyone. - If you know who is behind this,

937
01:03:31.380 --> 01:03:34.420
- do not tell me. - I should have taken them with me.

938
01:03:34.650 --> 01:03:36.290
Please punish me.

939
01:03:36.420 --> 01:03:39.090
Please punish me for leaving my children behind.

940
01:03:39.260 --> 01:03:42.330
You can curse at me, and you can blame me,

941
01:03:42.390 --> 01:03:44.860
- so please say something. - I came because I was scared.

942
01:03:44.930 --> 01:03:46.600
I felt like I would do something reckless.

943
01:03:46.830 --> 01:03:49.300
Gyu Rim, can we just cut ties for good?
